Package: simmicrobes
Title: Simulate Microbes in the Soils
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    c(
        person(given = "Max", family = "Yuan", email = "max.yuan@example.com",
               role = c("aut", "cre")),
        person(given = "Steven", family = "Wu", email = "stevenwu@ntu.edu.tw",
               role = c("aut"))
    )
Description: Provides a framework for simulating microbial population   
    dynamics in soil environments. This package allows users to model
    the growth, interaction, and response of various microbial species
    to different environmental factors, facilitating in-silico
    experiments for soil ecology research.
